 "note": "Ozzy: the owner's own very fat solid-black short-haired cat, glossy blue-black with a soft sheen, vivid green eyes, a giant low-hanging fupa (its own 'belly' bone, swings and jiggles), red leather collar with silver spikes and a glowing ember-orange fang charm (rune_tag). A lovable little menace. Egg-only, never spawns naturally.",
 "ability_desc": "Ankle Biter: when a monster comes near you while he's with you, he drops into a low crouch, wiggles his enormous butt and pounces on it, biting (damage and knockback; harder and more often at higher bond). He also ambushes your own ankles now and then: grabs, bites, bunny-kicks, then saunters off like nothing happened (harmless). A very fat, glossy solid-black short-haired cat with vivid green eyes, smallish ears, full cheeks and a giant fupa that hangs nearly to the floor and swings when he walks; a red spiked collar with a glowing ember fang charm. 82 clips, 26 of them his own: sprawls belly-up in the sun on carpets (back legs splayed, his feather toy beside him), struts so the fupa swings, murders his feather toy, lashes his tail, glares, loafs, flops over like a sack of bricks, tries to lick his own fupa and can't reach it, sneezes, hunt-wiggles at nothing, washes and stretches. Greets you by trotting up, head-bonking you twice... and biting. Demands fish with grabby paws and puffs up his fat arch at creepers. Petting: he tolerates it with a lashing tail, gives you a love bite, or rolls over and bunny-kicks your hand; pet him too much and it's murder mittens. Not found in the wild: spawn him with his egg; he arrives already named Ozzy and is tamed with raw cod.",
